-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 166% of normal and November to December at 41%. The 2026 figures published so far start low, with January to February at 53% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
